5823c433476f5292948b03.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>3033年毫无预兆妖异橫行末日來临凡人退避唯有冥币豁免代价，小伙放弃上市公司放弃豪宅換取冥币統一妖异</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202404/25/xVP18BGSKn80/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part10.json"}, {"id": 111794, "title": "极寒九十九", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240425-1/c99321155ac7f9ce37a56f20004fbd96.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>蓝星受到五十年光年外的一颗超新星的爆炸影响，迎來了全球性的寒武风暴！上一世我因为轻女神鬼话开门，被偷袭致死！如今我重活一世，觉醒间异能守护愛人，报前世之仇！</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全·集", "url": "https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202404/25/q1dfEYXsqS76/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part10.json"}, {"id": 111793, "title": "我的外卖不简单", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240425-1/2ea4c29b4948b9708f815a23613228aa.jpeg", "year": "2024", "area": "大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202404/25/9V2fasksS777/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part10.json"}, {"id": 111785, "title": "天师令", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240425-1/3e2be5f9ddaff5f747e03491fabad467.jpg", "year": "2023", "area": "大陆", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202404/25/smY9big6tB78/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part10.json"}, {"id": 111783, "title": "彼岸有你", "category": "脑洞悬疑", "pic": "https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240425-1/9d9359c2948ac09b7a3c6f35c802b231.png", "year": "2023", "area": "内地", "actor": "", "director": "", "content": "<p>我与死神谈恋爱，死神帮我去复仇。神和凡人真的不能相爱吗？ 即使剩下魂魄，三生石上除名也要和我爱的人在一起</p>", "episodes": [{"name": "全集", "url": "https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202404/25/0v7J4zhKb978/video/index.m3u8"}], "data_file": "cat_dfa080be27_part10.json"}, {"id": 111777, "ti